{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">旺角昨晚（12日）發生交通意外。一輛私家車沿旺角道轉入康樂街時，撞倒一名59歲女途人，女途人手腳擦傷送院。網上流傳一段車Cam片，直擊涉事私家車在轉彎前後連續切線，懷疑收掣不及肇禍。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-13-12h45m30s172.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ejBgrn0AEk1786596641.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-13-12h45m30s172.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片中所見，事發地點為旺角一處4線行車路段，當時一輛白色私家車在左二線等候燈號，當燈號轉為綠燈時，私家車突然切線至左一線，並左轉入旺角道。其後該私家車在旺角道再一口氣連切4條行車線右轉入康樂街，期間懷疑收掣不及，撞倒一名途人。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-13-12h45m38s991.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026f85TQSU6BA1786596647.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-13-12h45m38s991.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方表示，於昨晚9時53分接報，指一輛私家車沿旺角道轉入康樂街時，撞傷一名59歲女途人，女傷者手腳擦傷，送院時保持清醒，由救護車送往廣華醫院接受治理。涉事的52歲男司機事後通過酒精呼氣測試，事件中無人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T06:07:16.105324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}